{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e07-scene-08",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "俺を納得させる材料を持ってきてくれ  (Bring Me Proof That Will Convince Me)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kawada": "川田",
    "keieisha": "経営者",
    "toshi": "トシ"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Kawada visits a major video chain Proprietor only to learn Poseidon threatened to boycott any shop selling their studio's tapes, while Toshi hands their stolen master tape to Furuya to raise fast cash. Listen for \"atsuryoku\", outside pressure.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "お願いします、力を貸してください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "実はな、規制委員会からこんなものが届いてな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "これ、圧力ですか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "あんたらの作品を販売すると、ポセイドンの作品は販売もできなくなるんだとよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "俺にも社員っていう家族が増えちまってな、生活もかかってる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "業界シェア八割の売れ筋を失うわけにはいかねえ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "だったら俺を納得させる材料を持ってきてくれ。話はそれからだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "分かりました、出直します。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "これでお願いします。まだ終わってません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "古谷さん、お願いします、力貸してください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "経営者なら分かんだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "はい。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "お願いします、力を貸してください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please, lend us your strength.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "実はな、規制委員会からこんなものが届いてな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Actually, a notice like this arrived from the regulation committee.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "これ、圧力ですか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is this outside pressure on you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "あんたらの作品を販売すると、ポセイドンの作品は販売もできなくなるんだとよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They say if we sell your film, we won't be allowed to sell Poseidon titles anymore.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "俺にも社員っていう家族が増えちまってな、生活もかかってる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My family of employees has grown too, and their livelihoods are on the line.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "業界シェア八割の売れ筋を失うわけにはいかねえ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I cannot afford to lose top sellers holding eighty percent of the market share.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "だったら俺を納得させる材料を持ってきてくれ。話はそれからだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you want this, bring me proof that convinces me. Then we will talk.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "分かりました、出直します。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Understood, I will come back better prepared.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "これでお願いします。まだ終わってません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please work with this tape. It isn't over yet.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "古谷さん、お願いします、力貸してください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr. Furuya, please lend me your help.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "keieisha",
      "t": "経営者なら分かんだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As a business owner yourself, you understand, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "はい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, I do.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
